#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:59
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "方法"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:63
msgid "Initialise the CAN bus with the given parameters:"
msgstr "使用给定参数初始化 CAN 总线："

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:65
msgid "*bitrate* is the desired bus bit rate in bits per second."
msgstr "*bitrate* 是期望的总线位速率，单位为比特每秒。"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:66
msgid ""
"*mode* is one of the values shown under `can-modes`, indicating the desired "
"mode of operation. The default is \"normal\" operation on the bus."
msgstr "*mode* 是 `can-modes` 下所列值之一，用于指示期望的工作模式。默认值为总线上的“normal”（正常）工作模式。"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:69
msgid ""
"The next parameters are optional and relate to CAN bit timings. In most "
"cases you can leave these parameters set to the default values:"
msgstr "接下来的参数是可选的，与 CAN 位定时相关。在大多数情况下，你可以将这些参数保持为默认值："

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:72
msgid ""
"*sample_point* is an integer percentage of the data bit time. It specifies "
"the position of the bit sample with respect to the whole nominal bit time. "
"The CAN driver will calculate parameters accordingly. This parameter is "
"ignored if *tseg1* and *tseg2* are set."
msgstr ""
"*sample_point* 是数据位时间的整数百分比。它指定采样点相对于整个标称位时间的位置。CAN 驱动将据此计算参数。如果设置了 *tseg1* "
"和 *tseg2*\\ ，则忽略此参数。"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:76
msgid ""
"*sjw* is the resynchronisation jump width in units of time quanta for "
"nominal bits; it can be a value between 1 and 4 inclusive for classic CAN."
msgstr "*sjw* 是标称位的重新同步跳转宽度，以时间量子为单位；对于经典 CAN，它可以是 1 到 4（含）之间的值。"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:78
msgid ""
"*tseg1* defines the location of the sample point in units of time quanta for"
" nominal bits; it can be a value between 1 and 16 inclusive for classic CAN."
" This is the sum of the ``Prop_Seg`` and ``Phase_Seg1`` phases as defined in"
" the ISO-11898 standard. If this value is set then *tseg2* must also be set "
"and *sample_point* is ignored."
msgstr ""
"*tseg1* 以标称位的时间量子为单位定义采样点的位置；对于经典 CAN，它可以是 1 到 16（含）之间的值。这是 ISO-11898 标准中定义的"
" ``Prop_Seg`` 和 ``Phase_Seg1`` 阶段之和。如果设置了此值，则也必须设置 *tseg2*\\ ，并且忽略 "
"*sample_point*\\ 。"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:83
msgid ""
"*tseg2* defines the location of the transmit point in units of the time "
"quanta for nominal bits; it can be a value between 1 and 8 inclusive for "
"classic CAN. This corresponds to ``Phase_Seg2`` in the ISO-11898 standard. "
"If this value is set then *tseg1* must also be set."
msgstr ""
"*tseg2* 以标称位的时间量子为单位定义发送点的位置；对于经典 CAN，它可以是 1 到 8（含）之间的值。这对应于 ISO-11898 标准中的 "
"``Phase_Seg2``\\ 。如果设置了此值，则也必须设置 *tseg1*\\ 。"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:88
msgid ""
"If these arguments are specified then the CAN controller is configured "
"correctly for the desired *bitrate* and the specified total number of time "
"quanta per bit. The *tseg1* and *tseg2* values override the *sample_point* "
"argument if all of these are supplied."
msgstr ""
"如果指定了这些参数，则 CAN 控制器会针对期望的 *bitrate* 和指定的每位时间量子总数进行正确配置。如果同时提供了所有这些参数，则 "
"*tseg1* 和 *tseg2* 的值会覆盖 *sample_point* 参数。"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:93
msgid ""
"Individual controller hardware may have additional restrictions on valid "
"values for these parameters, and will raise a ``ValueError`` if a given "
"value is not supported."
msgstr "各个控制器硬件对这些参数的有效值可能有额外限制，如果某个给定值不受支持，将引发 ``ValueError``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:97
msgid ""
"Specific controller hardware may accept additional optional keyword "
"parameters for hardware-specific features such as oversampling."
msgstr "特定的控制器硬件可能会接受额外的可选关键字参数，用于过采样等硬件专用特性。"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:102
msgid "Set receive filters in the CAN controller. *filters* can be:"
msgstr "在 CAN 控制器中设置接收过滤器。\\ *filters* 可以是："

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:104
msgid "``None`` to accept all incoming messages, or"
msgstr "``None`` 表示接受所有传入消息，或"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:105
msgid "``[]`` or ``()`` to disable all message receiving, or"
msgstr "``[]`` 或 ``()`` 表示禁用所有消息接收，或"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:106
msgid ""
"An iterable of one or more items defining the filter criteria. Each item "
"should be a tuple or list with three elements:"
msgstr "一个包含一个或多个项的可迭代对象，用于定义过滤条件。每一项应是一个具有三个元素的元组或列表："

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:109
msgid "``identifier`` is a CAN identifier (int)."
msgstr "``identifier`` 是一个 CAN 标识符（int）。"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:110
msgid "``bit_mask`` is a bit mask for bits in the CAN identifier field (int)."
msgstr "``bit_mask`` 是 CAN 标识符字段中各位的位掩码（int）。"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:111
msgid ""
"``flags`` is an integer with zero or more of the bits defined in `can-flags`"
" set. This specifies properties that the incoming message needs to match. "
"Not all controllers support filtering on all flags, a ``ValueError`` is "
"raised if an unsupported flag is requested."
msgstr ""
"``flags`` 是一个整数，由 `can-flags` "
"中定义的零个或多个位组成。它指定传入消息需要匹配的属性。并非所有控制器都支持对所有标志进行过滤，如果请求了不支持的标志，将引发 "
"``ValueError``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:116
msgid ""
"Incoming messages are accepted if the bits masked in ``bit_mask`` match "
"between the message identifier and the filter ``identifier`` value, and "
"flags set in the filter match the incoming message."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``bit_mask`` 中掩码的各位在消息标识符与过滤器 ``identifier`` "
"值之间相匹配，且过滤器中设置的标志与传入消息相匹配，则传入消息被接受。"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:120
msgid ""
"If the `CAN.FLAG_EXT_ID` bit is set in flags, the filter matches Extended "
"CAN IDs only. If the `CAN.FLAG_EXT_ID` bit is not set, the filter matches "
"Standard CAN IDs only."
msgstr ""
"如果标志中设置了 `CAN.FLAG_EXT_ID` 位，则过滤器仅匹配扩展 CAN ID。如果未设置 `CAN.FLAG_EXT_ID` "
"位，则过滤器仅匹配标准 CAN ID。"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:124
msgid ""
"All filters are ORed together in the controller. Passing an empty list or "
"tuple for the filters argument means that no messages will be received."
msgstr "控制器中的所有过滤器之间是“或”关系。为 filters 参数传入空列表或空元组意味着不会接收任何消息。"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:127
msgid ""
"Some CAN controllers require each filter to be associated with only one "
"receive FIFO. In these cases, the filter items in the argument are allocated"
" round-robin to the available FIFOs. This driver does not distinguish "
"between FIFOs in the receive IRQ."
msgstr ""
"某些 CAN 控制器要求每个过滤器仅关联一个接收 FIFO。在这些情况下，参数中的过滤器项会以轮询方式分配到可用的 FIFO。本驱动在接收 IRQ "
"中不区分各个 FIFO。"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:132
msgid ""
"If the caller passes an iterable with more items than "
":data:`CAN.FILTERS_MAX`, ``ValueError`` will be raised."
msgstr "如果调用方传入的可迭代对象包含的项数多于 :data:`CAN.FILTERS_MAX`\\ ，将引发 ``ValueError``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:135
msgid ""
"If either the ``identifier`` or the ``bit_mask`` is out of range for the "
"specified ID type, a ``ValueError`` with reason \"invalid id\" will be "
"raised."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``identifier`` 或 ``bit_mask`` 超出了指定 ID 类型的范围，将引发原因为“invalid id”的 "
"``ValueError``\\ 。"

